Third-Party Dataset Attribution Notice:
The source code and experimental tooling in this repository are licensed under
the MIT License above. External smart-meter and meteorological datasets used in
this research remain subject to their respective upstream terms:
1. CEEW Smart Meter Dataset — "High frequency smart meter data from two districts
   in India (Mathura and Bareilly)" (Agrawal, Mani, Ganesan, & Jain, 2021):
   Harvard Dataverse, V2 (doi:10.7910/DVN/GOCHJH), distributed under CC0 1.0
   Universal Public Domain Dedication.
2. IIIT Delhi Faculty Housing Dataset — "Replication Data for: Information
   Strategies for Energy Conservation: A Field Experiment in India" (Chen,
   Delmas, Locke, & Singh, 2017): Harvard Dataverse, V1 (doi:10.7910/DVN/7MEXN4),
   distributed under CC0 1.0 Universal Public Domain Dedication.
3. ERA5-Land Hourly Reanalysis (Muñoz-Sabater et al., 2021): Copernicus Climate
   Change Service (C3S) via the Open-Meteo Historical Weather API
   (doi:10.24381/cds.e2161bac), distributed under Creative Commons Attribution
   4.0 International (CC BY 4.0) / Copernicus C3S attribution terms.
